      "process_md": "\n1. Applicants have to visit [official portal.](https://rajkisan.rajasthan.gov.in/)1. Click on login.\n1. On new page applicant can login with their Jan-Aadhaar Number OR\n1. Applicants can also login with their SSO ID on [sso portal.](https://sso.rajasthan.gov.in/signin)1. Now students can log in with their Jan-Aadhaar ID. 1. Fill out the application form.\n1. Attach the required documents.\n1. Submit.\n\n",
